{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46779","headline":"荆州贯休大师旧房 · 齐己","name":"荆州贯休大师旧房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疎篁抽笋柳垂阴，旧是休公种境吟。\n入贡文儒来请益，出官卿相驻过寻。\n右军书画神传髓，康乐文章梦授心。\n销得青城千嶂下，白莲标塔帝恩深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}